{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 45, :comments ["<b>Why should I be bereft of you both, etc.</b> The meaning is: even if it happens that he too dies, whether by your hand or by the hand of the blood-avengers, even so there is no remedy for your bereavement in that he too dies with you on a single day. And she is forever concerned only about the death of Jacob, not about Esau."], :book :genesis, :voice :or-hachaim, :lang :en, :chapter 27, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T19:44:05.343833681Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}